{"layout":"logicalStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>股票</p>","expand":true,"uid":"ea9ffb68-f8ae-4e56-b764-4b607d6dfd69","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{},"freeNodeTrees":[]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>客观至上，该撤就撤，除非你做长线</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"30aa6efc-7079-460d-81e9-3e0843f6fb4c","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>及时止损，保存有生力量</p>","uid":"c9efaaa0-2be3-4dc7-96bf-3fa7d24f877f","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>不要和趋势作对</p>","uid":"788038c2-96a3-4adf-8213-a9f40f88335e","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>仓位管理，风控</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"72f49e2d-a0cb-49bf-8c55-7cf823827053"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>不要满仓</p>","uid":"47739622-b9b0-4529-af8e-bed2fecb9f0f","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>复盘分析，提升技术，迭代战法</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"d48d6e02-16fe-4f0e-9bb5-d5b22006363d"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>突发性利好就是利好，预期性利好就是利空，突发性利空是暴跌，预期性利空可以观察和埋伏</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"3319d59c-adb1-45a4-b383-bbb45a00f664"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>基本技术</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"e63f057d-b13b-48b8-9c95-57deb438c1a7"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>k线研究</p>","uid":"035e5abb-8411-4c1a-9028-f53bc3b73e15","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>量价分析</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"dfa518f2-4720-4d47-bb56-6221f0351aba"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>进阶</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"d9c69c25-54fd-4177-b06c-67937a7c0d99"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>四个面</p>","uid":"299a2205-44ba-4b5b-8443-3ed05852d436","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>技术面</p>","uid":"419a824e-2437-49ff-8596-491f